          "content": "## Calendar Adapter (Google)\nThe only place that talks to the calendar provider. Operations: `get_busy` (free/busy only, no event details), `create_event` (Meet link when call_format = meet), `update_event` (move times), `delete_event`. Every output has `ok`. A future Outlook adapter must keep the same inputs and outputs.",
